eg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T05:09:56-07:00","id":930777,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/928813-readers-visiting-astral?p=928856#post928856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You will laugh but I would go to the realm of &quot;My Little Pony&quot; for the sole purpose of learning how my cutie mark looks like. Actually, any realm of self-discovery would be great.</div> </div> </div> </div> Laugh at you? That sounds like a great idea. I hope my cutie mark is related to creative writing or helping people understand themselves. What do you expect yours to look like?<br /> <br /> As for me, I'd<span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> get a lot of mileage out of a Temenos Realm of Ancient Philosophers. I imagine it as a peaceful natural park with a clear sky and birds chirping, with the philosophers endlessly and happily debating between themselves. Kinda like how Socrates hoped the afterlife would be like, from what I've read.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I would also like to take a detour to the Realm of Modern Philosophers, if only to speak with Nietzsche. He had some amazing ideas that are helping me IRL nowadays, but I admit I don't fully understand him.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, the Temenos Realm of Video Games. First Person Mario Kart, here I come!</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T08:45:12-07:00","id":930873,"title":"","content":"I have a creeping fear that I wouldn't have a cutie mark yet. Still, I expect something more on the analytical side of things.<br /> <br /> Realms of Philosophy sound like a great idea. I think I would also visit the Realm of Politics. The more respectable parts, anyway. Meeting Muhammad, Benjamin Franklin or Richelieu would have been amazing.<br /> <br /> Realm of Video Games... I don't know how you did that, but your post is rigged. The only thing it lets me do is to agree with everything you say.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T12:05:29-07:00","id":930969,"title":"","content":"Mine would be a short equation; I expect nothing different.<br /> <br /> =---=<br /> <br /> Realm of Romance or, if I was in <i>that</i> kind of mood, the Realm of Pornography.<br /> <br /> I'm a lonely man, and getting some &quot;practice&quot; in would certainly be nice.<br /> <br /> Then maybe the Realm of Music for some sweet tunes? For once, I could attend a concert that wouldn't send me into a panic attack!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}